
# Experiments I Would Like to Try

## 1. Vision Transformer vs CNN

I would compare a Vision Transformer with a CNN on the same image dataset to see how their performance differs.

## 2. Effect of Training Data

I would train or evaluate models using different amounts of training data to understand how data size affects their performance.

## 3. Effect of Image Patches

I would explore how changing the patch size affects the number of patches and the model's results.

## What I Expect to Learn

These experiments could help me understand the strengths and limitations of Vision Transformers and how training data and patch size affect image recognition.

